                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Fesler</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-22"><hi rendition="#italic">July 22,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Protest camphor monopoly under articles fourteenth French, and thirtieth United
                    States treaties, 1858.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
